          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिविर (śivir) is Sanskrit śibira (also written śivira), \"a royal camp, a tent\" (Monier-Williams). Today it is a camp of any kind: राहत (rāhat) शिविर, a relief camp."
