          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डेरा (ḍerā) is inherited from ḍēra, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 5564), which gathers words for tents and resting places. डेरे में रहना is to live in a camp or a shelter, away from home."
            }
          ]
